= 0.9.9.9.11 | 2026-07-26
# PvP
> The PvP mode switch was half-migrated to the expert hands, so several gates were reading the wrong flag.
Fixed Red Fist doing nothing: you could lock a target but every hit was silently dropped, and runes or targeted spells were refused with a secure mode warning
