Changed auto scrap to never destroy gear you have worn: once equipped an item is permanently exempt, so moving equipment into your bag to upgrade it is safe
Changed auto scrap to only act on items you have just picked up, so turning a filter on can never eat what is already in your backpack
Changed the item type chips in the scrap filter to mean "scrap this type" instead of "keep this type"; your existing selection is converted for you on login
Added a wiki section explaining the three auto scrap filters and everything they will never touch

# Minimap
Added NPC icons to the minimap, one per spawned NPC on the floor you are viewing, with shopkeepers marked separately

# Autocast
Added Health and Mana Tonics to Auto Setup: if you are carrying them, the rotation adds use rules paced to their real cooldown

# Interface
Changed unique and mythic items to a magenta highlight instead of red, across tooltips, chat links, containers, the bestiary and loot previews
Added an ornate frame to item tooltips, with a larger item name, group dividers and a rarity tinted border
Improved readability of effect and flavour text in item tooltips
Fixed spell descriptions being cut off in the Spell List, which now wraps them properly

